<div class="viz-page">
  <aside class="viz-sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-head">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">Home</a>
      <h3>Trees</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="bst-controls">
      <h4>Change the tree</h4>
      <div class="bst-input-group">
        <input type="number" id="bstInput" placeholder="1 to 99" min="1" max="99" aria-label="Value to insert">
        <button class="btn-control btn-play" onclick="bstInsert()">Insert</button>
      </div>
      <div class="bst-input-group">
        <input type="number" id="bstSearchInput" placeholder="Value" min="1" max="99" aria-label="Value to search for">
        <button class="btn-control" onclick="bstSearch()">Search</button>
      </div>
      <div class="bst-input-group">
        <input type="number" id="bstDeleteInput" placeholder="Value" min="1" max="99" aria-label="Value to delete">
        <button class="btn-control" onclick="bstDelete()">Delete</button>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-control full-width" onclick="bstRandom()" style="margin-top:8px">Random tree</button>
      <button class="btn-control full-width" onclick="bstClear()" style="margin-top:8px">Clear</button>
    </div>

    <div class="traversal-panel">
      <h4>Walk the tree</h4>
      <div class="traversal-btns">
        <button class="trav-btn" onclick="bstTraverse('inorder')">Inorder</button>
        <button class="trav-btn" onclick="bstTraverse('preorder')">Preorder</button>
        <button class="trav-btn" onclick="bstTraverse('postorder')">Postorder</button>
      </div>
      <div class="traversal-result" id="traversalResult"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="complexity-panel">
      <h4>Complexity</h4>
      <div class="complexity-grid">
        <div class="c-item"><span class="c-label">Search</span><span class="c-val c-good">O(log n)</span></div>
        <div class="c-item"><span class="c-label">Insert</span><span class="c-val c-good">O(log n)</span></div>
        <div class="c-item"><span class="c-label">Delete</span><span class="c-val c-good">O(log n)</span></div>
        <div class="c-item"><span class="c-label">Space</span><span class="c-val c-ok">O(n)</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="complexity-note">Those are for a balanced tree. Insert 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 in order and it turns into a linked list: O(n).</p>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="viz-main">
    <div class="viz-header">
      <h1 class="viz-title">Binary search tree</h1>
      <p class="viz-desc">Everything smaller goes left, everything bigger goes right. Insert, search and delete, and watch the path each one takes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-bar">
      <div class="stat-pill">Nodes <strong id="bstNodeCount">0</strong></div>
      <div class="stat-pill">Height <strong id="bstHeight">0</strong></div>
      <div class="stat-pill">Steps <strong id="bstSteps">0</strong></div>
      <div class="stat-pill status-pill" id="bstStatus">Insert a value to begin</div>
    </div>

    <div class="tree-canvas-wrap">
      <svg id="treeSvg" class="tree-svg" width="100%" height="500"></svg>
    </div>

    <div class="explanation-box" id="bstExplanation">
      <div id="bstExplanationText">Type a number and press <strong>Insert</strong>, or start from a random tree.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="code-panel">
      <div class="code-panel-header">
        <span class="code-panel-title">The operation, in JavaScript</span>
        <span class="code-hint" id="bstCodeTitle">Insert</span>
      </div>
      <div class="code-body">
        <pre class="code-pre" id="bstCodeDisplay"><code id="bstCodeLines"></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/algorithms/trees.js"></script>
